      "number": 1,
      "arab": "بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ أَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصْحَٰبِ ٱلْفِيلِ",
      "arab_kemenag": "اَلَمْ تَرَ كَيْفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِاَصْحٰبِ الْفِيْلِۗ",
      "latin": "Alam tara kaifa fa‘ala rabbuka bi'aṣḥābil-fīl(i).",
      "translation_id": "Tidakkah engkau (Nabi Muhammad) memperhatikan bagaimana Tuhanmu telah bertindak terhadap pasukan bergajah?",
      "translation_en": "Have you not considered, [O Muhammad], how your Lord dealt with the companions of the elephant?",
